a-text=\"Ἀφροδισίας\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἀφροδισία\">Ἀφροδισίας</span>  <span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"καί\">καὶ</span>  <span data-text=\"Θευδᾶ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Θεῦδας\">Θευδᾶ</span>  <span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"καί\">καὶ</span>  <span data-text=\"Μαρύλλας\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Μαρύλλα\">Μαρύλλας</span>  <span data-text=\"εἰς\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"εἰς\">εἰς</span>  <span data-text=\"μνείαν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"μνεία\">μνείαν</span>  <span data-text=\"γονέων\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"γονεύς\">γονέων</span>  <span data-text=\"τέκνα\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"τέκνον\">τέκνα</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐποίησαν\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ποιέω\">ἐποίησαν</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀφροδισίας\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀφροδισίας\"><span data-text=\"Ἀφροδισίας\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἀφροδισία\">[....]ΔΙΣΙΑΣ</span></span></span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"καί\">ΚΑΙ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Θευδᾶ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Θευδᾶ\"><span data-text=\"Θευδᾶ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Θεῦδας\">[..]ΥΔΑ</span></span></span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"καί\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μαρύλλας\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μαρύλλας\"><span data-text=\"Μαρύλλας\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Μαρύλλα\">ΜΑΡΥΛΛΑΣ</span></span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"εἰς\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"εἰς\">ΕΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"μνείαν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"μνεία\">ΜΝΕΙΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"γονέων\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"γονεύς\">ΓΟΝΕΩΝ</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"τέκνα\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"τέκνον\">ΤΕΚΝΑ</span><span data-text=\"ἐποίησαν\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ποιέω\">ΕΠΟΙΗΣΑΝ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Ἀφροδισίας\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Ἀφροδισία\">ΑΦΡΟΔΙΣΙΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"καί\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"Θευδᾶ\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Θεῦδας\">ΘΕΥΔΑ</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"καί\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"Μαρύλλας\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Μαρύλλα\">ΜΑΡΥΛΛΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"εἰς\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"εἰς\">ΕΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"μνείαν\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"μνεία\">ΜΝΕΙΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"γονέων\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"γονεύς\">ΓΟΝΕΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"τέκνα\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"τέκνον\">ΤΕΚΝΑ</span><span data-text=\"ἐποίησαν\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ποιέω\">ΕΠΟΙΗΣΑΝ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text of IGPalermo. Ferrara placed a punctuation mark between the words.</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>(Property of) Aphrodisia, Theudas, Marylla. The sons built (i.e. this) in memory of their parents.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This is an epitaph found on a stone plaque. The syntax of the epitaph is complex and has led to differing interpretations. Ferrara (1829, 342) believed that two brothers (Aphrodisias and Maryllas) and a sister (Theuda) had dedicated the tomb to their parents. Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 465) shared this view, but understood the names in the genitive case (in this case, Aphrodisias and Maryllas would be the daughters, Theudas the son), without explaining why the names of the dedicators would appear in this case while the names of the parents were not expressed. Franz (ap. CIG III 5698), followed by Manni Piraino (1973, 28), however, held a different opinion, interpreting the genitives as dependent on <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">τὸ μνημεῖὸν ἐστι</span>, thus effectively taking these names as those of the parents, while the names of the sons would not have been expressed. The sons would therefore have been born to a single father (Theudas), but to two different mothers (Aphrodisia and Marylla). Another possibility would be to understand the genitive as an expression of ownership: having built the tomb for their parents, the sons may have wished to claim that it was their exclusive property. <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἀφροδίσια</span> is a fairly common female name in Sicily (LGPN 3A p. 86), <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Θεῦδας</span> could be an epichoric form for <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Θεόδωρος</span> (on which, see Manni Piraino 1973, 28) and <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Μαρύλλας</span> is attested in another inscription from Catania (IG 14.491 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000361\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000361</a>).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Franz 1853 5698 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">465</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Hoffmann 1904 5237 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817</a>  </li><li> Manni Piraino 1973 7 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1  10-18  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
